        "text": "Reference class and base rate: for a two-month-ahead level forecast of a seasonally adjusted EI beneficiary count, the base rate is persistence from the latest available level with recent official monthly changes. Same-variant anchors are all Canada regular EI beneficiaries, seasonally adjusted, from the same Statistics Canada EI series, not gross claims, LFS unemployment, or unadjusted counts."
